      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Joker is punk: the Neon style setting is shared between all projects, so if you had it set in an old project, it would still be on in a new one.\nI tried to reproduce this myself, and indeed I found that turning off the Neon style did not immediately change the style, but a simple close and reopen of the graph window afterwards did. Can you try this?\nhttps://media.giphy.com/media/7qET5mNqCGA3JAZcbG/giphy.gif",
      "viewerReactions": null
